      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَحْنَثْتُهُ</span></b>  (S, K) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى يَمِينِهِ</span> (S) <i>I made him to
violate,</i> or <i>break,</i> or <i>fail of performing, his oath.</i>
(S, K. *) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احنث فُلَانٌ قَسَمَ فُلَانٍ</span> <i>Such a one
assented not,</i> or <i>consented not, to the conjurement
of such a one; contr. of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبَرَّ</span>. (T and TA in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بر</span>.)

